static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras_big/8d0b270fdf70722155aa32b4eb771358.avif?t=1753879891 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon proficiency through a skill tree and equip various enhancements to gain an edge in battle. Experiment with different builds and tailor Inayah\u2019s abilities to match your preferred way of playing! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/7658a1456f75f8f2f2df71f0c851ef47.poster.avif?t=1753879891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/7658a1456f75f8f2f2df71f0c851ef47.webm?t=1753879891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/7658a1456f75f8f2f2df71f0c851ef47.mp4?t=1753879891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/2b829f292aa35e8954b16644cb95acdf.avif?t=1753879891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras_big/2b829f292aa35e8954b16644cb95acdf.avif?t=1753879891 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> The game boasts stunning 2D art and meticulously hand-drawn frame-by-frame animations.<br>This commitment to high-quality aesthetics ensures that each moment in INAYAH is a feast for the eyes, setting it apart from other 2D platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/6ea7dfad584b34add9dfd70f784d9a6c.poster.avif?t=1753879891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/6ea7dfad584b34add9dfd70f784d9a6c.webm?t=1753879891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/6ea7dfad584b34add9dfd70f784d9a6c.mp4?t=1753879891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Interact with the inhabitants of this unforgiving world, uncover hidden lore, and shape Inayah\u2019s destiny. Offer help or follow your own path, and carefully consider the consequences of your actions. Unlock multiple endings and see what fate awaits Inayah and her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey in <strong>&quot;INAYAH \u2013 Life After Gods&quot;</strong>, where challenging trials and emotional stories await on your path to finding home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/b44eb7d1d73663d1b192100351e96ca0.avif?t=1753879891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras_big/b44eb7d1d73663d1b192100351e96ca0.avif?t=1753879891 width=800 height=599 /></span></p>","developers":["Exogenesis Studios"],"dlc":[3617800],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/header.jpg?t=1753879891","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Exogenesis Information Technology - FZCO. INAYAH \u2013 Life After Gods, its logo, Exogenesis Studios and the Exogensis Studios logo are trademarks of Exogenesis Information Technology \u2013 FZCO, UAE.<br />\r\n\u00a92025 Headup Gm